#The VB program is described in a tech memo accessed from Help > Technical Memos > Example: Automating Runs with the VS API.
#
#Note that this simulation is overlaid with the Quick Start Guide, Baseline example to demonstrate that the simulation results to do not differ between running the VB wrapper program and the baseline example.
